# f3 R2 "The Trench" — the pit row cuts the room in two and the only way north is to push
# the crate at (6,4) into it (02-entities §4.2). Two pushes: (6,4) -> (6,3) -> into the pit,
# where the crate is consumed and the cell becomes a permanent bridge. The two coins on the
# far side are unreachable without it.
floor f3
room R2
at 6,5
assert room=R2 hp=6 treasure=0

U 85                       # charge, push, charge, push, then walk over the bridge
assert room=R2 hp=6        # across the trench, unhurt

L 40                       # west along row 1, over both coins
assert room=R2 hp=6 treasure=2
